                "description": {
                    "value": "<p>When the dream cradle is destroyed, the egg-balloon shatters, releasing a cloud of nightmarish oneiric energy. Creatures other than the pilot and passengers within 30 feet of the dream cradle take @Damage[14d6[mental]|options:area-damage] damage (@Check[will|dc:32|basic|options:area-effect,inflicts:fleeing,inflicts:frightened] save). On a failed save, the creature is also @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Frightened]{Frightened 2} (@UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Frightened]{Frightened 4} and @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Fleeing] for 1 round on a critical failure). The dream cradle then uses that last of its magical reserves to cast @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.spells-srd.Item.Fly] on the pilot and each passenger.</p>"
